Select the native bridge at early-init instead: Berberis by default, Houdini from its
remembered GRUB entry. Google's existing init hooks select the matching ARM64 libraries
and executable handlers.
Drop when one translator works for the owner's apps and the GRUB choice is removed.

--- a/system/build.prop
+++ b/system/build.prop
@@ -163,7 +163,6 @@
